// P3F.4 (`intro-to-parametric-cad.md` P5.1–P5.3, P5.6): design intent with variables. The
// hydraulic cylinder body (`Custom("design-intent")`, `cadrs_core::samples::design_intent`):
// #piston_d = 40 mm and #clearance = 0.5 mm at the top of the list; the master sketch on Front
// revolved into the Body (bore Ø #piston_d + #clearance, wall 5, 100 long); one O-ring groove
// (2 deep, 2 wide) patterned ×3; the Piston Ø #piston_d; the Clamp whose bore uses the piston's
// edge.
// 01 the model and its feature list: the two variables (#piston_d, #clearance) first.
// 02 #piston_d's Variable dialog: 40 mm with its description.
// 03 the Body selected, Mass properties: Volume 69869.021 mm³ (π/4·(OD² − ID²)·100 − the three
//    grooves).
// 04 (P3F.3–P3F.4 judge) the Body made see-through (Edit appearance, 30 % opacity): the bore,
//    the three grooves and the Piston inside it, the Clamp around the piston.
// 05 the master sketch opened with Show expressions on: the bore's dimension reads
//    "Ø#piston_d + #clearance" (the wall 5, the length 100 stay values); the later sketches
//    (rolled back while it is edited) aren't drawn.
// 06 #piston_d edited to 50 mm in its Variable dialog: one edit; the body, the grooves, the piston
//    and the clamp's bore (Use) all follow, no feature errors: seen through the Body, as 04.
// 07 Mass properties of the Body again: 85199.993 mm³.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("design-intent"),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-model-and-variables"),
        DoubleClick(ui("feature-piston-d")),
        WaitFor("variable-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-piston-d-variable"),
        Click(ui("variable-dialog-cancel")),
        Click(ui("part-row-body")),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "69869.021"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-body-volume-40"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        ClickAt(1420, 900),
        Custom("part-look 1 #9BC1D84C"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-see-through-body-40"),
        DoubleClick(ui("feature-master-sketch")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        Click(ui("sketch-show-expressions")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-master-sketch-expression"),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        DoubleClick(ui("feature-piston-d")),
        WaitFor("variable-dialog"),
        Click(ui("variable-value-field")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("50 mm"),
        Click(ui("variable-dialog-title")),
        Click(ui("variable-dialog-accept")),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-piston-d-50"),
        ClickAt(1420, 900),
        Click(ui("part-row-body")),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "85199.993"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-body-volume-50"),
    ],
)
